# copy-skill.mjs writes the canonical klodi-plugin/klodi-skill/ here at
# build time, into a namespaced klodi-skill/ so the published host skill
# slug can't collide with other plugins shipping a generic skill/ folder.
# The adapter-local copy is a build artifact; the source of truth is the
# repo-root klodi-skill/ directory shared by all hosts.
klodi-skill/
